https://github.com/bootlin/toolchains-builder.git

- checkout master
- ./update_gitlab-ci.sh -t no_push -n 2025.05-26 -b toolchains.bootlin.com-2022.08.2 -a x86-64 -l glibc -v stable
- checkout to the new branch created
- ./build-toolchain.sh x86-64--glibc--stable releases toolchains.bootlin.com-2022.08.2 1
- cancel at ">>> host-skeleton"
- cp build/output/.config this_repo_dir/config_x86-64
- Edit this_repo_dir/config_x86-64
  - To target gcc version while ensuring continuity:
    - Correct:
    | # BR2_GCC_VERSION_10_X is not set
    | # BR2_GCC_VERSION_11_X is not set
    | # BR2_GCC_VERSION_12_X is not set
    | # BR2_GCC_VERSION_13_X is not set
    | BR2_GCC_VERSION_14_X=y
    | ...
    | BR2_GCC_VERSION="14.3.0"

    - Wrong:
    | # BR2_GCC_VERSION_10_X is not set
    | # BR2_GCC_VERSION_11_X is not set
    | # BR2_GCC_VERSION_12_X is not set
    | BR2_GCC_VERSION_14_X=y
  - BR2_HOST_DIR from absolute path to "$(BASE_DIR)/host"

- cd this_repo_dir
- rm .config
- cp config_x86-64 .config
- rm -rf output
- make
- cd output/host
- delete usr and x86-64-buildroot-linux-gnu/sysroot
- tar -czvf ../<filename>.tar.gz *
 
* Do the same for aarch64
